# Converted from the old Grade 2 Survex data (Grade2/Grade2/OverTheTop.svx).

# > Ogof Draenen: Over The Top
# 
# This data represents a fairly rough compass & tape survey with
# occasional estimated clino readings.
# 
# Survey conducted on Monday 2nd January by Morgannwg Caving Club.
# Surveyed by: Ali Garman & Huw Jones
# Data entry: Ali Garman

survey overthetop

# Station Equivalences

# Specify units of measurement

# Magnetic North to Grid North correction
# Mag deviation at the time of the readings (9-Oct-94) was
# 4.2 degrees (data from OS sheet 161, 1991).

# Data ordering

centreline
  # BCRA2
  sd length 0.5 metres
  sd compass clino 2.5 degrees
  calibrate compass 4.2
  data normal from to length compass clino
  1	2	15.4	149	0	# continues as 4m square passager
  # over traverse
  2	3	20.3	142	0
  3	4	7.5	173	0
  4	5	3.0	65	+30	# ='OO' station 47
  4	6	20.3	160	0
  6	7	3.7	130	0
  7	8	7.7	165	0	# climb down and up again here
  8	9	13.5	145	0
  9	10	9.7	265	-66	# down climb (X4)
  10	11	5.4	90	-30
  11	12	5.6	300	-40
  12	13	3.0	353	-45	# bottom of inlet in main streamway

endcentreline
survey ott2

centreline
  # BCRA2
  sd length 0.5 metres
  sd compass clino 2.5 degrees
  calibrate compass 4.2
  data normal from to length compass clino
  2	1	10.2	170	0	# = OverTheTop station 1
  3	2	8.6	146	0
  4	3	11.0	126	0	# bolt before traverse under rock
  # bridge
endcentreline
endsurvey

endsurvey
